{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37511","headline":"赠李裕先辈 · 周朴","name":"赠李裕先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓擎弓箭入初场，一发曾穿百步杨。\n仙籍旧题前进士，圣朝新奏校书郎。\n马疑金马门前马，香认芸香阁上香。\n闲伴李膺红烛下，慢吟丝竹浅飞觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}